{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33848","headline":"奉和添酒中六咏 酒龙 · 皮日休","name":"奉和添酒中六咏 酒龙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜爲蚴蟉鳞，铸作鱙𬵩角\n吐处百里雷，泻时千丈壑。\n初疑潜苑囿，忽似拏寥廓。\n遂使铜雀台，香消野花落。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}